    "created_at": "2015-09-28T17:53:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-28T17:53:32Z",
    "body": "> If RadioNodeList is only needed on `<form>`\n\nIt's needed on `form.elements` and on `<form>`.  I'm sorry I didn't make that clearer.\n\n> thought you said only `<form>` needs to support RadioNodeList\n\nBoth `<form>` and `form.elements` need to support it.  Nothing else needs to, as far as I can tell.\n",
