    "updated_at": "2015-09-29T09:14:21Z",
    "body": "It seems both Chrome and Safari implement `<fieldset>.elements` as `HTMLFormControlsCollection`, including `RadioNodeList`.\n\nPerhaps it would be better to refactor Gecko's implementation so it can reuse the one from `<form>`?\n",
