    "updated_at": "2015-09-29T12:07:18Z",
    "body": "The refactoring is doable.  But having to keep all that state around means a lot of memory usage or CPU usage or both.  So I don't think the refactoring is _desirable_.  For `<form>` we're stuck with the compat issue of needing it, but I don't want to add that time and complexity elsewhere if it's not actually needed.\n",
