    "body": "Sorry, I missed this in my notifications. Are we now talking about just making `HTMLFieldSetElement.elements` an `HTMLCollection` instead of a `HTMLFormControlsCollection`? Is it implicit that the matched elements would also change, or is it just a matter of not having that `namedItem()`?\n\nI could easily add a use counter to see if removing `HTMLFormControlsCollection.elements` entirely is feasible, but I'd also like to understand the risks in the originally proposed change.\n",
